2a7fe048216a0ccf28fd196daaf5bf7fd3fff.png)\n\n \n\nAs we can see, the correct answer is:\n\n$\\,$ *\"The net of III consists of $1$ rectangle and $4$ triangles.\"*\n\nOther statements are false. \n\n- *\"The net of II consists of triangles only\"* is false since the net of II has $3$ rectangles (the side faces).\n\n- *\"The net of I has one triangle\"* is not true because the net of I contains only squares.\n\n- *\"The net of III consists of $4$ triangles and $2$ rectangles\"* is false since the net of III only has $1$ rectangle (the base of the solid).\n\n- *\"The net of I consists of exactly $8$ squares\"* is not true because the net of I only has $6$ squares." 13194139536104 17592186045417 true] [17592186148895 1075 #edb/ref 17592186148896 13194139536104 17592186045417 false] [17592186148895 1075 #edb/ref 17592186148897 13194139536104 17592186045417 false] [17592186148895 1075 #edb/ref 17592186148898 13194139536104 17592186045417 false] [17592186148895 1075 #edb/ref 17592186148899 13194139536104 17592186045417 false] [17592186148895 1075 #edb/ref 17592186148900 13194139536104 17592186045417 false] [17592186148895 1075 #edb/ref 17592186565812 13194139536104 17592186045417 true] [17592186148895 1075 #edb/ref 17592186565826 13194139536104 17592186045417 true] [17592186148895 1075 #edb/ref 17592186566027 13194139536104 17592186045417 true] [17592186148895 1075 #edb/ref 17592186566028 13194139536104 17592186045417 true] [17592186148895 1075 #edb/ref 17592186566044 13194139536104 17592186045417 true] [17592186148895 1078 #edb/ref 17592186565826 13194139536104 17592186045417 true] [17592186150809 1075 #edb/ref 17592186150810 13194139536104 17592186045417 false] [17592186150809 1075 #edb/ref 17592186150811 13194139536104 17592186045417 false] [17592186150809 1075 #edb/ref 17592186150812 13194139536104 17592186045417 false] [17592186150809 1075 #edb/ref 17592186150813 13194139536104 17592186045417 false] [17592186150809 1075 #edb/ref 17592186150814 13194139536104 17592186